{{天体平衡 Celestial Balance}}
{{死亡降临 Death Is Nigh}}
{{创造熔炉 Forge of Creation}}
{{自由即生命 Freedom Is Life}}
{{高等奥术 High Arcana}}
{{月亮号角 Horns of the Moon}}
